{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}
{% block title %}AA Resources | Area 75{% endblock %}
{% block body %}
<div class="page-title-bar">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="{{ path('app_home') }}">Home</a> › <a href="#">About</a> › <span>AA Resources</span></div>
    <h1>A.A. Resources in Southern Wisconsin</h1>
    <p>Local central offices and intergroups providing AA services across Area 75</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="page-content">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:880px;">

    <p>The following are the telephone numbers and addresses of the four local central offices and one intergroup located in southern Wisconsin. These offices provide: receiving and following up on calls from individuals and family members regarding A.A. meetings; publishing local meeting lists; and ordering, selling, and distributing A.A. Conference approved literature.</p>

    <div class="card-grid" style="margin-top:2rem;">

      <div class="contact-card">
        <h3>Madison Area Intergroup Central Office (MAICO)</h3>
        <address>
          2820 Walton Commons Suite 101<br>Madison, WI 53718<br>
          <strong>📞 (608) 222-8989</strong><br>
          <a href="mailto:info@aamadisonwi.org">info@aamadisonwi.org</a><br>
          <a href="http://www.aamadisonwi.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">aamadisonwi.org</a>
        </address>
        <p style="margin-top:.75rem; font-size:.85rem; color:var(--text-muted);">
          <strong>Hours:</strong> Tue–Thu 11am–6pm · Fri–Sat 11am–2pm<br>
          24-hour answering service available.<br>
          <em>Counties served:</em> Adams, Sauk, Dodge, Lafayette, Rock, Green Lake, Richland, Green, Iowa, Jefferson, Grant, Dane, Columbia, Juneau, Crawford, Marquette, and portions of southern Waushara.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-card">
        <h3>Racine Area Central Office</h3>
        <address>
          3701 Durand Avenue, #225 B<br>Racine WI 53045<br>
          <strong>📞 Office: (262) 554-6611</strong><br>
          <strong>🆘 Hotline: (262) 554-7788</strong><br>
          <a href="mailto:racostaff@racinecentraloffice.org">racostaff@racinecentraloffice.org</a><br>
          <a href="http://www.racinecentraloffice.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">racinecentraloffice.org</a>
        </address>
        <p style="margin-top:.75rem; font-size:.85rem; color:var(--text-muted);">
          <strong>Hours:</strong> Mon–Fri 9am–5pm · Sat 9am–1pm<br>
          <em>Counties:</em> Racine and Kenosha.
        </p>
      </div>

