        <address>
          P.O. Box 572 · 86 South Portland<br>Fond du Lac, WI 54936-0572<br>
          <strong>📞 Hotline: (920) 922-7512</strong><br>
          <a href="mailto:winnebagolandco@gmail.com">winnebagolandco@gmail.com</a><br>
